<title>PHILIPPINES: China Bank sets record date for rights.</title>
<headline>China Bank sets record date for rights.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The China Banking Corp said on Friday it had set February 7 as the record date for its two-for-three rights issue.</p>
<p>The shares will be sold at 200 pesos apiece beginning February 7 until March 24.</p>
<p>Payment has been set in four tranches, with the first payment on March 24 and subsequently every six months thereafter.</p>
<p>The proceeds of the offer shall be used to partially finance the bank's branch expansion programme and upgrading of its computer system, the bank said.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
